            "question": "What is included in the Sun Resilience System?",
            "answer": "One UV Shield+ (60 capsules) and one Dermaboost+ (60 capsules)."
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Why combine these two formulas?",
            "answer": "UV Shield+ and Dermaboost+ overlap in antioxidant support: UV Shield+ is aimed at skin exposed to the environment, and Dermaboost+ adds immune-supportive nutrition for skin resilience.†"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I take the products in this system?",
            "answer": "Take each product as directed on its label. The directions for both are shown on this page."
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does the system fit with sunscreen?",
            "answer": "UV Shield+ is made to be used alongside your sunscreen, protective clothing and shade. It is not a sunscreen and does not replace sun protection."
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Should I check with my healthcare professional first?",
            "answer": "Consult your healthcare professional before taking if you are pregnant, nursing, taking any medications or have a medical condition."
          }
        }
